      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "cold",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>60 feet. A clammy, frigid mist billows forth ahead of the adlet. Creatures within the mist become Concealed, and creatures outside the mist become concealed to creatures within it. An adlet can see through the aura without penalty. When mounted on a frost roc, this aura emanates from the roc, not the adlet, and the roc gains the ability to see through the aura without penalty as well.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
