        "cold",
        "concentrate",
        "primal"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The roc rider's mist turns biting cold and coalesces into a thick rime of frost that deals 7d6 Cold Damage damage to creatures inside the roc rider's aerial wolfstorm aura (Basic DC 31 Fortitude Saving Throw), and the aura is deactivated until the start of the roc rider's next turn.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
